  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Livelihoods and Food Security Fund LIFT for Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIFT&#x2019;s goal is to sustainably reduce the number of people living in poverty, hunger and strengthen the resilience and sustainable livelihoods of poor and vulnerable people, with a focus on women. LIFT&apos;s focus since 2021 has been around supplementing humanitarian responses, promoting localisation, supporting community and household resilience, and bolstering community nutrition and food security.</narrative>
  </description>
